{"book":19,"chapter":135,"context":{"chapter":135,"title":"The LORD Does Whatever He Pleases","summary":"God's servants are called to praise him: he chose Israel, rules the weather, struck Egypt, defeated Sihon and Og and gave their land, while idols are powerless.","background":"No title; it begins and ends with 'Praise ye the LORD.' A hymn built largely from other passages: verse 1 echoes 134:1, verse 7 matches Jeremiah 10:13, and the idol mockery (vv. 15–18) repeats Psalm 115:4-8. Sihon of the Amorites and Og of Bashan were kings Israel defeated east of the Jordan (Numbers 21:21-35).","customs":[],"watchFor":["'Israel for his peculiar treasure' (v. 4; Exodus 19:5).","The call to bless the LORD by house of Israel, Aaron, Levi and all who fear him (vv. 19–20)."],"connections":["Exodus 19:5","Jeremiah 10:13","Psalms 115:4-8","Numbers 21:21-35"]},"verses":{"1":{"w":[["הַלְלוּ","halu","H1984","HVpv2mp","praise"],["יָהּ","yah","H3050","HNpm","Yahweh"],["הַלְלוּ","halu","H1984","HVpv2mp","praise"],["אֶת","'et-","H853","HTo","<obj.>"],["שֵׁם","shem","H8034","HNcmsc","[the] name of"],["יְהוָה","yahweh","H3068","HNpt","Yahweh"],["הַלְלוּ","halu","H1984","HVpv2mp","praise"],["עַבְדֵי","'avdei","H5650","HNcmpc","O servants of"],["יְהוָה","yahweh","H3068","HNpt","Yahweh"]],"x":[[19096001,19096004,10],[19007017,19007017,8],[19033001,19033002,7],[19111001,19111001,7],[19106001,19106001,6],[19107008,19107008,6],[19112001,19112001,6],[19148013,19148013,6],[19149001,19149003,6],[19150006,19150006,6]],"xn":17},"2":{"w":[["שֶׁעֹמְדִים","she'omedim","H5975","HTr/Vqrmpa","who [are] standing"],["בְּבֵית","beveit","H1004","HR/Ncmsc","in [the] house of"],["יְהוָה","yahweh","H3068","HNpt","Yahweh"],["בְּחַצְרוֹת","bechatzrot","H2691","HR/Ncbpc","in [the] courts of"],["בֵּית","beit","H1004","HNcmsc","[the] house of"],["אֱלֹהֵינוּ","'eloheinu","H430","HNcmpc/Sp1bp","God our"]],"x":[[19116019,19116019,5],[19092013,19092013,4],[19096008,19096008,3],[42002037,42002037,3]],"xn":4},"3":{"w":[["ה